[PrintTextModified Text:我得想办法把她赶走。|#0202Bad02_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:刚才，我听到有人说要来洗澡。<br>要是你在这画画的话，人家就没办法洗澡了。|#0202Bad02_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro

[PrintTextModified Text:况且，这里本来就是不让画画的。|#0202Bad02_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:唔～真小气。|#0202Bad02_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚有些闹别扭似的鼓起脸颊。|#0202Bad02_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro

[PrintTextModified Text:如果你实在想画的话，<br>也要等别人洗完澡再来画。|#0202Bad02_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:明明有专门用来画画的地方，<br>就不要到这里来给人添麻烦了。|#0202Bad02_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah

[PrintTextModified Text:……唔～好吧。<br>那诺亚去画室里画了。|#0202Bad02_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Noah Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚气鼓鼓的很是不高兴，<br>但还是转身回了自己的画室。|#0202Bad02_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:（很好，这下就没人碍事了）|#0202Bad02_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我仔细确认过周围没人以后，<br>走进淋浴房。|#0202Bad02_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:30_2
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_27_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:（接下来，只要等艾玛过来……）|#0202Bad02_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我边祈祷别再有人闯进来边等了一会，<br>到了约好的时间，艾玛准时来了淋浴房。|#0202Bad02_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，希罗……！|#0202Bad02_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，你来了。|#0202Bad02_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，我们约好了嘛！|#0202Bad02_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（啊，真叫人作呕）|#0202Bad02_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:一看到她这张傻乎乎的脸，<br>我就气得快要七窍生烟。|#0202Bad02_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我得赶紧消灭掉<br>　她这样不正确的存在）|#0202Bad02_Hiro009|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我努力按捺住熊熊燃烧的怒火，<br>按照计划好的那样，装作换衣服的样子<br>握紧在画室找到的工具。|#0202Bad02_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000FF Duration:0.5 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@ModifyCamera Offset:,2 Zoom:0.5 Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:然后，走到正在换衣服的艾玛身后。|#0202Bad02_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:0.5 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:（啊，终于到这时候了）|#0202Bad02_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……不知怎的，<br>我回想起了以前的时光。|#0202Bad02_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（终于——）|#0202Bad02_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们以前……|#0202Bad02_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:……希罗？|#0202Bad02_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:1 Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Smile1
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:——能杀死你了。|#0202Bad02_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

; 固いもので頭を殴る音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_167 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#660000FF Duration:0.1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@ModifyCamera Offset:0 Zoom:0 Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:呜啊……|#0202Bad02_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_27_2 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@HideAllCharacters Duration:0 Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:2.5 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:125 AppearanceAndTransition:30_2

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛当即倒下。|#0202Bad02_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（——我杀死她了！）|#0202Bad02_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:太好了。<br>我终于杀死艾玛了。|#0202Bad02_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有多久没体会到如此痛快的感觉了。|#0202Bad02_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我按捺住冲上心头的喜悦之情，<br>抓着艾玛的肩膀把她抱起来。|#0202Bad02_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#FF000044 Duration:0.5 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:丢着不管的话，<br>她的尸体迟早会被找到。|#0202Bad02_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我得把艾玛丢进垃圾滑槽里。|#0202Bad02_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:本以为尸体会很沉，<br>没想到我可以轻轻松松抬起来。|#0202Bad02_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:心底荡漾着欢欣与喜悦，<br>仿佛不再是原来的那个我。|#0202Bad02_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是怎么回事——<br>算了。|#0202Bad02_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管我感到有一丝异样，但现在可顾不上那么多了。|#0202Bad02_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我把艾玛的尸体塞进垃圾滑槽里。|#0202Bad02_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ダストシュートから死体を落とす音（ガタコンッ）
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_168 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000FF Duration:0.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay

[PrintTextModified Text:就这样，她的尸体顺着滑槽掉了下去。|#0202Bad02_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我一边用淋浴头冲洗血迹，一边等待。|#0202Bad02_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000044 Duration:0.5 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@SpawnBlur ActorId:MainBackground
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:下方是焚烧炉。<br>下午3点启动。|#0202Bad02_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（快了，时间快到了……）|#0202Bad02_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:正当我万分焦急地盯着手机上的时钟时，<br>却忽然听见滑槽底下传来了声音。|#0202Bad02_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_27_3 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

; 立ち絵なし
; ボイス加工：ダクトから聞こえる声

[PrintTextModified Text:呜、呜呜……<br>希罗，希罗，救救我……！|#0202Bad02_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（艾玛的声音……！？<br>　她没死吗……！？）|#0202Bad02_Hiro016|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么会这样。|#0202Bad02_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我又看了眼时钟。<br>焚烧炉的启动时间正一分一秒地逼近。|#0202Bad02_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 立ち絵なし
; ボイス加工：ダクトから聞こえる声

[PrintTextModified Text:求求你！求求你了……！<br>救我出去！|#0202Bad02_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 立ち絵なし
; ボイス加工：ダクトから聞こえる声

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起！是我错了……！|#0202Bad02_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 立ち絵なし
; ボイス加工：ダクトから聞こえる声

[PrintTextModified Text:小雪是我害死的！<br>对不起，希罗！|#0202Bad02_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 立ち絵なし
; ボイス加工：ダクトから聞こえる声

[PrintTextModified Text:都是我的错！求你救救我吧……！|#0202Bad02_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……你总算醒悟了吗）|#0202Bad02_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不正确的存在必须要烧得一干二净。|#0202Bad02_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你说得没错，艾玛。|#0202Bad02_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你这个有罪之人就带着悔恨去死吧。<br>……你会死在这里的。|#0202Bad02_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 立ち絵なし
; ボイス加工：ダクトから聞こえる声

[PrintTextModified Text:什么……！<br>对不起，希罗……！|#0202Bad02_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:烦死了……去死！去死！去死！|#0202Bad02_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

; 立ち絵なし
; ボイス加工：ダクトから聞こえる声

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起！对不起！！<br>对不起……！|#0202Bad02_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……啊，到时间了。<br>不正确的存在终于要从这个世上消失了。|#0202Bad02_Hiro021| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

