[PrintTextModified Text:这是……|#0202Bad02_Hiro023| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我能清楚地看见，<br>那些观望处刑现场的少女脸上的表情。|#0202Bad02_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所有人都极度厌恶地看着我。|#0202Bad02_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:……为什么你要杀了艾玛亲！|#0202Bad02_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

