[PrintTextModified Text:（……没错）|#0202Bad02_Hiro024| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（审判的结果是……我杀害艾玛的罪行败露，<br>　得到了最高票数）|#0202Bad02_Hiro025|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（在我击中她的那一瞬间……她就死了）|#0202Bad02_Hiro026| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（原来我最后听见的那些忏悔和惨叫……<br>　只是我的幻觉）|#0202Bad02_Hiro027|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……然而，无论那些东西是真是假）|#0202Bad02_Hiro028| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（事实就是……我杀害了艾玛）|#0202Bad02_Hiro029| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:我感到心里无比的畅快。|#0202Bad02_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我的确杀死了艾玛，这是无可辩驳的事实。<br>　犯罪者本就该受到正义的制裁）|#0202Bad02_Hiro030|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（即便我杀死的是<br>　不正确的存在）|#0202Bad02_Hiro031|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且，我还有【下次机会】。|#0202Bad02_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

